{"id": "unknown-2026-05-21-008", "date": "2026-05-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India launches Bharat Tex 2026 app with AI-powered assistance tool", "content": "India has launched the Bharat Tex 2026 app to enhance the experience of buyers, delegates, speakers, sourcing consultants, partners, exhibitors and visitors at the country’s largest global textile event, scheduled to be held from July 14 to 17 in New Delhi. \nThe app can be used by participants to access event information, find exhibitors, schedule meetings, navigate the venue and receive real-time updates. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-launches-bharat-tex-2026-app-with-ai-powered-assistance-tool-310455-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-21-009", "date": "2026-05-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.62, "keywords": ["decline", "concerns", "weak", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton sees mixed trend as rain forecasts weaken sentiment", "content": "ICE cotton futures remained under pressure as improving rainfall forecasts across major US cotton-growing regions eased crop concerns and weighed on market sentiment.\nThe July 2026 contract fell 0.89 per cent to 81.60 cents, marking its fifth decline in seven sessions.\nLower crude oil prices, subdued trading activity, and weak speculative participation also added bearish pressure on cotton prices.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-sees-mixed-trend-as-rain-forecasts-weaken-sentiment-310452-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-21-010", "date": "2026-05-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Tariffs did not rewire apparel sourcing. They exposed its limits.", "content": "US apparel sourcing is shifting away from China, but TexPro data shows diversification remains Asia-led, not nearshoring-led.\nVietnam, Bangladesh, Cambodia and Indonesia are gaining relevance, while Mexico and CAFTA-DR remain limited.\nThe real 2026 advantage is qualified optionality: audited, scalable, compliant suppliers that can absorb tariff, legal and supply shocks.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/tariffs-did-not-rewire-apparel-sourcing-they-exposed-its-limits--310450-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-21-011", "date": "2026-05-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["[否定]growth", "uncertainty"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Higher oil costs, El Nino to shrink FY27 Indian growth to 6.7%: Ind-Ra", "content": "Ind-Ra has projected India’s GDP growth at 6.7 per cent YoY in FY27. \nThe agency believes higher fuel and food prices due to the Middle East conflict’s uncertainty and the likely impact of evolving El Nino on agriculture from mid-2026 will pull down growth in FY27. \nA $10/bbl rise in crude oil prices could reduce GDP growth by 44 bps, while a 10-per cent reduction in capex could lower growth to 6 per cent. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/higher-oil-costs-el-nino-to-shrink-fy27-indian-growth-to-6-7-ind-ra-310436-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-21-012", "date": "2026-05-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Morocco, Bangladesh to deepen cooperation in trade & investment", "content": "Morocco and Bangladesh recently agreed to deepen cooperation in trade, investment, agriculture, skill development and multilateral affairs when the latter’s State Minister for Foreign Affairs Shama Obaed Islam met the former’s Foreign Minister Nasser Bourita in Rabat. \nIslam reiterated Bangladesh's interest in promoting eco-friendly jute and jute goods in the Moroccan market. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/morocco-bangladesh-to-deepen-cooperation-in-trade-investment-310433-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "vf_corp-2026-05-21-013", "date": "2026-05-21", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": ["vf_corp"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["growth", "expand", "improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "US' VF Corporation returns to FY26 growth, Q4 revenue up", "content": "VF Corporation has returned to growth in FY26, with revenue up 1 per cent and ex-Dickies revenue rising 4 per cent. \nMargins expanded, operating income reached $577 million, and leverage improved to 3.1x. \nQ4 revenue rose 1 per cent, led by Americas momentum, The North Face and Timberland growth, while VF reinstated FY27 guidance for continued growth and higher margins. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/us-vf-corporation-returns-to-fy26-growth-q4-revenue-up-310458-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
